  "description": "Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel.\nAn attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system.\nThis update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:\n  - Stream parser;\n  - x86 architecture;\n  - GPU drivers;\n  - HID subsystem;\n  - I3C subsystem;\n  - MemoryStick subsystem;\n  - Network drivers;\n  - Ethernet team driver;\n  - NVME drivers;\n  - S/390 drivers;\n  - SCSI subsystem;\n  - Greybus lights staging drivers;\n  - Realtek RTL8723BS SDIO drivers;\n  - Thunderbolt and USB4 drivers;\n  - TTY drivers;\n  - USB Device Class drivers;\n  - USB core drivers;\n  - USB Gadget drivers;\n  - USB Host Controller drivers;\n  - USB Serial drivers;\n  - USB Mass Storage drivers;\n  - USB Type-C Port Controller Manager driver;\n  - TI TPS6598x USB Power Delivery controller driver;\n  - Ceph distributed file system;\n  - File systems infrastructure;\n  - F2FS file system;\n  - Network file system (NFS) server daemon;\n  - File system notification infrastructure;\n  - OCFS2 file system;\n  - SMB network file system;\n  - Kernel futex primitives;\n  - VLANs driver;\n  - Netfilter;\n  - TCP network protocol;\n  - Audit subsystem;\n  - BPF subsystem;\n  - Perf events;\n  - Watch queue notification mechanism;\n  - Memory management;\n  - Bluetooth subsystem;\n  - Ethernet bridge;\n  - Networking core;\n  - HSR network protocol;\n  - IPv4 networking;\n  - IPv6 networking;\n  - IUCV driver;\n  - MAC80211 subsystem;\n  - Management Component Transport Protocol (MCTP);\n  - Netlink;\n  - Open vSwitch;\n  - Packet sockets;\n  - RDS protocol;\n  - Network traffic control;\n  - SCTP protocol;\n  - SMC sockets;\n  - TIPC protocol;\n  - TLS protocol;\n  - VMware vSockets driver;\n  - Wireless networking;\n  - AppArmor security module;\n  - Key management;\n  - ALSA framework;\n  - Analog Devices audio codecs;\n  - USB sound devices;\n(CVE-2022-49622, CVE-2022-50167, CVE-2023-53733, CVE-2025-38728,\nCVE-2025-40135, CVE-2026-31678, CVE-2026-53353, CVE-2026-64015,\nCVE-2026-64190, CVE-2026-74341, CVE-2026-74406, CVE-2026-74739,\nCVE-2026-80852, CVE-2026-80861, CVE-2026-80947, CVE-2026-89481,\nCVE-2026-89492, CVE-2026-89553, CVE-2026-89625, CVE-2026-89633,\nCVE-2026-89638, CVE-2026-89640, CVE-2026-89652, CVE-2026-89672,\nCVE-2026-89680, CVE-2026-89685, CVE-2026-89707, CVE-2026-89761,\nCVE-2026-89837, CVE-2026-89987, CVE-2026-90016, CVE-2026-90029,\nCVE-2026-93179, CVE-2026-93199, CVE-2026-97529, CVE-2026-97530,\nCVE-2026-97555, CVE-2026-97557, CVE-2026-97558, CVE-2026-97564,\nCVE-2026-97615, CVE-2026-97939, CVE-2026-98170, CVE-2026-98171,\nCVE-2026-98193, CVE-2026-98377, CVE-2026-98386, CVE-2026-98451,\nCVE-2026-98454, CVE-2026-98456, CVE-2026-98490, CVE-2026-98507,\nCVE-2026-98549, CVE-2026-98568, CVE-2026-98655, CVE-2026-98681,\nCVE-2026-98686, CVE-2026-98694, CVE-2026-98698, CVE-2026-98700,\nCVE-2026-98701, CVE-2026-98704, CVE-2026-98705, CVE-2026-98706,\nCVE-2026-98707, CVE-2026-98708, CVE-2026-98709, CVE-2026-98716,\nCVE-2026-98726, CVE-2026-98735, CVE-2026-98739, CVE-2026-98741,\nCVE-2026-98742, CVE-2026-98750, CVE-2026-98752, CVE-2026-98753,\nCVE-2026-98754, CVE-2026-98760, CVE-2026-98761, CVE-2026-98763,\nCVE-2026-98769, CVE-2026-98772, CVE-2026-98794, CVE-2026-98805,\nCVE-2026-98811, CVE-2026-98812, CVE-2026-98823, CVE-2026-98836,\nCVE-2026-98838, CVE-2026-98846, CVE-2026-98850, CVE-2026-98857,\nCVE-2026-98862, CVE-2026-98944, CVE-2026-98950, CVE-2026-98955,\nCVE-2026-98956, CVE-2026-98964, CVE-2026-98967, CVE-2026-98969,\nCVE-2026-98977, CVE-2026-98984, CVE-2026-98985, CVE-2026-98990,\nCVE-2026-98992, CVE-2026-98993, CVE-2026-99002, CVE-2026-99006,\nCVE-2026-99008, CVE-2026-99010, CVE-2026-99015, CVE-2026-99019,\nCVE-2026-99025, CVE-2026-99027, CVE-2026-99031, CVE-2026-99032,\nCVE-2026-99033, CVE-2026-99038, CVE-2026-99039, CVE-2026-99041,\nCVE-2026-99053, CVE-2026-99054, CVE-2026-99056, CVE-2026-99072,\nCVE-2026-99077, CVE-2026-99080, CVE-2026-99081, CVE-2026-99082,\nCVE-2026-99083, CVE-202